        "title": "Redesign dashboard with Ink & Ember design system",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nComplete visual reimagining of stats.store — from stock v0.dev/shadcn template to a distinctive \"Ink & Ember\" design system.\n\n### Design\n\n- **Palette**: warm near-black observatory canvas (dark) / warm paper (light), hairline borders, ember-orange accent, phosphor-mint live signal, subtle film grain + top-edge glow\n- **Typography**: Fraunces display serif for the wordmark and hero, Spline Sans Mono for every number, tick, and label (via next/font, self-hosted)\n- **Layout**: sticky blurred header with theme toggle, editorial hero with staggered load reveal, oversized tabular KPI numerals in a hairline-divided band (no more boxed cards), numbered 12-column bento chart grid, three-column footer\n\n### Tech cleanup\n\n- globals.css rewritten as a clean Tailwind v4 `@theme` token set in oklch — deletes ~460 lines of unused hardcoded legacy utilities and all recharts `!important` tooltip hacks\n- Fixes latent `hsl(var(--x))` double-wrap bugs in chart grid/tooltip colors (vars already contain full color values)\n- Shared chart theme in `lib/chart-theme.ts`; line charts upgraded to gradient area charts, donuts gain compact value/share legends\n- New `ChartCard` and `ThemeToggle` components; deleted unused `KpiCardSimple`\n- `prefers-reduced-motion` respected for all animation\n\n### Testing\n\n- `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm build` clean\n- 220/220 tests pass (assertions updated for new markup)\n- Codex structured review clean (1 doc finding fixed)\n",
